@welsione/dsh-model-router README · dsh-model-router：> Unified model routing plugin: one logical **ModelID** backed by multiple providers' equivalent models, organized into **plans** (each with three tiers `tier1/2/3`) — first-token failover with cooldown, health-aware ranking, per-candidate reasoning effort; manual per-session tier picking in the chat window, and a settings panel that **auto-saves every change** to routes and model capabilities.
>
> 📦 Published on npm: [`@welsione/dsh-model-router`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@welsione/dsh-model-router)

